[
  {
    "text": "The most dangerous manipulator",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.96
  },
  {
    "text": "is not the one",
    "start": 1.96,
    "end": 2.84
  },
  {
    "text": "that lies to your face.",
    "start": 2.84,
    "end": 4.46
  },
  {
    "text": "It's the one that tells you",
    "start": 4.46,
    "end": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "the truth,",
    "start": 5.4,
    "end": 6.26
  },
  {
    "text": "just slightly twisted.",
    "start": 6.26,
    "end": 8.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Real manipulators don't argue.",
    "start": 8.2,
    "end": 10.16
  },
  {
    "text": "They agree with you.",
    "start": 10.16,
    "end": 11.2
  },
  {
    "text": "Slowly, they nod.",
    "start": 11.2,
    "end": 12.78
  },
  {
    "text": "When you speak,",
    "start": 12.78,
    "end": 13.8
  },
  {
    "text": "they mirror your energy.",
    "start": 13.8,
    "end": 15.2
  },
  {
    "text": "They make you feel seen,",
    "start": 15.2,
    "end": 16.64
  },
  {
    "text": "understood,",
    "start": 16.64,
    "end": 17.52
  },
  {
    "text": "validated.",
    "start": 17.52,
    "end": 18.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And the moment your guard drops,",
    "start": 18.32,
    "end": 20.08
  },
  {
    "text": "they plant an idea.",
    "start": 20.08,
    "end": 21.38
  },
  {
    "text": "And they do it so subtly,",
    "start": 21.38,
    "end": 22.84
  },
  {
    "text": "you think it came from you.",
    "start": 22.84,
    "end": 24.66
  },
  {
    "text": "They don't control you with force.",
    "start": 24.66,
    "end": 26.58
  },
  {
    "text": "They merely guide you",
    "start": 26.58,
    "end": 27.58
  },
  {
    "text": "with suggestion.",
    "start": 27.58,
    "end": 28.28
  },
  {
    "text": "They don't change your mind.",
    "start": 28.28,
    "end": 30.02
  },
  {
    "text": "They steer it.",
    "start": 30.02,
    "end": 30.92
  },
  {
    "text": "You think you made the choice.",
    "start": 30.92,
    "end": 32.64
  },
  {
    "text": "That's the entire point.",
    "start": 32.64,
    "end": 34.32
  },
  {
    "text": "You didn't.",
    "start": 34.32,
    "end": 34.98
  },
  {
    "text": "The greatest manipulators",
    "start": 34.98,
    "end": 36.18
  },
  {
    "text": "never convince you of anything.",
    "start": 36.18,
    "end": 38.18
  },
  {
    "text": "They make the conditions",
    "start": 38.18,
    "end": 39.06
  },
  {
    "text": "where you convince yourself.",
    "start": 39.06,
    "end": 40.74
  },
  {
    "text": "And by the time you realize,",
    "start": 40.74,
    "end": 42.66
  },
  {
    "text": "you've already done",
    "start": 42.66,
    "end": 43.68
  },
  {
    "text": "exactly what they wanted,",
    "start": 43.68,
    "end": 45.36
  },
  {
    "text": "willingly.",
    "start": 45.36,
    "end": 46.74
  }
]